graph TB
    User["User / ODH Dashboard"] -->|creates| DSPACR["DataSciencePipelinesApplication CR<br/>datasciencepipelinesapplications.opendatahub.io/v1"]
    RHODS["rhods-operator"] -->|deploys via config/overlays/rhoai| Manager
    RHODS -.->|"creates (module flag on)"| AIPCR["AIPipelines CR<br/>components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1<br/>cluster singleton"]

    subgraph OperatorNS["Namespace: redhat-ods-applications"]
        subgraph Manager["DSPO controller-manager (/manager)"]
            DSPARec["DSPAReconciler"]
            AIPRec["AIPipelinesReconciler<br/>feature-gated"]
            ArgoRec["AIPipelinesArgoReconciler<br/>feature-gated"]
            Templates["config/internal/*.yaml.tmpl<br/>manifestival renderer"]
            Health["Health checks<br/>DB + object store"]
            Fetcher["Managed pipelines fetcher<br/>go-containerregistry"]
        end
        Webhook["ds-pipeline-webhook<br/>shared, 8443/TCP<br/>PipelineVersion admission"]
    end

    DSPACR -->|watched by| DSPARec
    AIPCR -->|watched by| AIPRec
    AIPCR -->|watched by| ArgoRec
    DSPARec -->|renders| Templates
    DSPARec --> Health
    DSPARec --> Fetcher
    DSPARec -->|"applies when pipelineStore=kubernetes"| Webhook

    subgraph DSPANS["Namespace: DSPA project namespace (per DSPA)"]
        APIServer["ds-pipeline-api-server<br/>KFP API 8888 HTTP / 8887 gRPC<br/>kube-rbac-proxy 8443 / 8445"]
        PA["ds-pipeline-persistenceagent"]
        SWF["ds-pipeline-scheduledworkflow"]
        WFC["ds-pipeline-workflow-controller<br/>Argo --namespaced"]
        MLMD["MLMD gRPC 8080 + Envoy 9090<br/>kube-rbac-proxy 8443 (optional)"]
        MariaDB["MariaDB 10.5 :3306<br/>(optional)"]
        MinIO["MinIO :9000<br/>(optional, dev only)"]
        PerDSPA["Per-DSPA RBAC, NetworkPolicies,<br/>Routes, service-CA TLS Secrets"]
    end

    Templates -->|creates| APIServer
    Templates -->|creates| PA
    Templates -->|creates| SWF
    Templates -->|creates| WFC
    Templates -->|creates| MLMD
    Templates -->|creates| MariaDB
    Templates -->|creates| MinIO
    Templates -->|creates| PerDSPA

    ArgoRec -->|installs| ArgoAssets["Shared Argo assets<br/>CRDs, aggregate ClusterRoles,<br/>argo SA/Role/ConfigMap"]
    AIPRec -->|manages| Monitoring["ServiceMonitor, PrometheusRule"]
    AIPRec -.->|deletes legacy| LegacyDSP["DataSciencePipelines<br/>default-datasciencepipelines"]

    PA -->|syncs workflow state| APIServer
    WFC -->|runs| Workflows["Argo Workflows<br/>driver / launcher pods"]
    APIServer -->|creates| Workflows
    SWF -->|reconciles| SWFCR["ScheduledWorkflow CR"]
    APIServer --> MariaDB
    APIServer --> MinIO

    Health -->|MySQL 3306| MariaDB
    Health -->|S3| MinIO
    Fetcher -->|OCI pull 443| Registries["Container registries"]
    DSPARec -->|resolves endpoint| MLflow["MLflow (mlflow-operator)"]

